{"seq":3,"slug":"viewport-overscan","title":"可见区与过扫描","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/foundations/viewport-overscan","wordCount":1244,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"可见区与过扫描\">可见区与过扫描</h1><p><a href=\"windowing-model\">窗口化模型</a> 留下了一个待填的空：窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[s, e]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 到底怎么算出来？这一篇把抽象落到算术上——给定 <code>scrollTop</code> 和视口高度，精确算出哪些行该进窗口；再回答一个看似多余、实则决定滚动手感的问题：为什么要在屏幕看得见的范围之外多渲染几行（过扫描），以及多渲染几行才合适。算清了可见区，机制章才有地基去讨论变高与测量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-可见区的边界计算\">核心概念：可见区的边界计算</h2><p>可见区（viewport range）是当前真正出现在屏幕上的索引区间。以定高列表为例，设行高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>、视口高度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>、当前滚动量 <code>scrollTop</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>visible</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mtext>scrollTop</mtext><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>e</mi><mtext>visible</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>scrollTop</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_\\text{visible} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{\\text{scrollTop}}{h} \\right\\rfloor, \\quad e_\\text{visible} = \\left\\lceil \\frac{\\text{scrollTop} + V}{h} \\right\\rceil - 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">visible</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scrollTop</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">visible</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scrollTop</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>起始索引向下取整（顶部那行可能只露出一半，仍要渲染），结束索引向上取整（底部那行同理）。可见行数约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil V/h \\rceil + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>——视口能塞下的整行数，再加上下边界各被切到的一行。</p>\n<p>举个具体数字：视口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = 600</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">600</span></span></span></span></span>、行高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = 50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span>、<code>scrollTop = 1280</code>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mn>1280</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = \\lfloor 1280/50 \\rfloor = 25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\">1280/50</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mn>1880</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>37</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e = \\lceil 1880/50 \\rceil - 1 = 37</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord\">1880/50</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37</span></span></span></span></span>。屏幕上此刻是第 25 到 37 行，共 13 行。变高列表里 <code>scrollTop / h</code> 这步除法要换成「在前缀和数组上二分查找」，逻辑同构，细节见 <a href=\"../mechanics/fixed-vs-variable-height\">定高与变高</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要过扫描\">为什么需要过扫描</h2><p>如果只渲染可见区，会有一个致命体验问题：滚动是连续的，而渲染是离散的。用户快速滚动时，新行要等到它进入可见区、触发重算、再经历一帧渲染才出现——在慢设备或重组件上，用户会先看到一片空白（俗称白屏/白条），下一帧内容才补上。</p>\n<p>过扫描（overscan）就是为消除这段空白而生：在可见区上下各多渲染 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 行，让窗口比屏幕「大一圈」。这样滚动时，即将进入屏幕的行已经渲染好了，用户永远落在已渲染区域内，看不到空白。窗口区间从可见区扩张为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>visible</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>e</mi><mtext>visible</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = \\max(0,\\ s_\\text{visible} - b), \\quad e = \\min(n - 1,\\ e_\\text{visible} + b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">visible</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">visible</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[整个数据:0 .. n-1] --&gt; B[过扫描上界:s_visible - b]&#10;  B --&gt; C[可见区上界:s_visible]&#10;  C --&gt; D[屏幕真正可见:s_visible .. e_visible]&#10;  D --&gt; E[可见区下界:e_visible]&#10;  E --&gt; F[过扫描下界:e_visible + b]&#10;  F --&gt; G[窗口 = 过扫描上界 .. 过扫描下界,已预渲染]&#10;  C -.滚动方向上的缓冲.-&gt; B&#10;  E -.滚动方向上的缓冲.-&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n  A[整个数据:0 .. n-1] --&gt; B[过扫描上界:s_visible - b]\n  B --&gt; C[可见区上界:s_visible]\n  C --&gt; D[屏幕真正可见:s_visible .. e_visible]\n  D --&gt; E[可见区下界:e_visible]\n  E --&gt; F[过扫描下界:e_visible + b]\n  F --&gt; G[窗口 = 过扫描上界 .. 过扫描下界,已预渲染]\n  C -.滚动方向上的缓冲.-&gt; B\n  E -.滚动方向上的缓冲.-&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"过扫描取多少-一场权衡\">过扫描取多少：一场权衡</h2><p>过扫描不是越大越好。它是「滚动平滑」与「渲染开销」之间的直接权衡：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>过扫描 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>滚动平滑度</th>\n<th>每帧渲染节点数</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>差，快滚必白屏</td>\n<td>最少</td>\n<td>几乎不用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1–3</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n<td>少</td>\n<td>行很重、渲染慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5–10</td>\n<td>好（常用默认）</td>\n<td>适中</td>\n<td>大多数列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20+</td>\n<td>极好但浪费</td>\n<td>多，可能抵消虚拟化收益</td>\n<td>极少，慎用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>经验法则：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 设到「一次惯性滑动在一帧内能跨过的行数」附近。多数库的默认值落在这个区间——例如 react-window 默认过扫描约为视口行数的一部分，TanStack Virtual 的 <code>overscan</code> 选项默认值通常取个位数。</p>\n<p>更进阶的做法是<strong>方向性过扫描</strong>：人滚动有方向性，向下滚时只需在下方多缓冲，上方可以收紧。据滚动速度与方向动态调整 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，能在平滑与开销之间取得更优的点。但这增加复杂度，先把固定过扫描做对再考虑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过扫描的隐藏成本与陷阱\">过扫描的隐藏成本与陷阱</h2><p>过扫描多渲染的行同样会触发组件的挂载、副作用与数据请求。这带来两个容易忽视的坑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>副作用过早触发</strong>：如果行组件在挂载时就发起请求或埋点，过扫描会让「还没看见」的行提前请求、提前上报，污染数据。解法是把「真正可见」与「已渲染」区分开——用 <code>IntersectionObserver</code> 判断真可见，而非用「在窗口内」判断。这与无限滚动的触底检测同源，见 <a href=\"../advanced/infinite-scroll-paging\">无限滚动与分页</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>过扫描放大重渲染成本</strong>：窗口越大，每次滚动重算时参与 diff 的行越多。若行组件未做 memo 化，过扫描会成倍放大主线程压力。框架层面如何避免无谓重渲染，见 <a href=\"../practice/virtualization-pitfalls\">虚拟化陷阱</a>，更普适的运行时优化见 <a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/runtime/rendering-performance\">运行时渲染性能</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可见区边界：起始 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mtext>scrollTop</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor \\text{scrollTop}/h \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scrollTop</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span> 向下取整，结束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>scrollTop</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil (\\text{scrollTop}+V)/h \\rceil - 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scrollTop</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 向上取整；变高时除法换成前缀和上的二分。</li>\n<li>过扫描在可见区上下各加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 行，把窗口扩大一圈，消除快滚时的白屏；窗口为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\max(0, s_v - b),\\ \\min(n-1, e_v + b)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是「平滑 vs 开销」的权衡，常用 5–10；进阶可做方向性/速度自适应过扫描。</li>\n<li>过扫描会让未真正可见的行提前触发副作用与重渲染，需用 <code>IntersectionObserver</code> 区分「真可见」与「已渲染」，并对行组件做 memo 化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>变高下可见区如何算：<a href=\"../mechanics/fixed-vs-variable-height\">定高与变高</a></li>\n<li>真可见触发加载：<a href=\"../advanced/infinite-scroll-paging\">无限滚动与分页</a></li>\n<li>过扫描放大的重渲染坑：<a href=\"../practice/virtualization-pitfalls\">虚拟化陷阱</a></li>\n<li>跨库——运行时渲染优化：<a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/runtime/rendering-performance\">运行时渲染性能</a></li>\n<li>跨库——主线程与长任务：<a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/runtime/event-loop-rendering\">主线程与长任务</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可见区与过扫描","id":"可见区与过扫描"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：可见区的边界计算","id":"核心概念-可见区的边界计算"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要过扫描","id":"为什么需要过扫描"},{"level":2,"text":"过扫描取多少：一场权衡","id":"过扫描取多少-一场权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"过扫描的隐藏成本与陷阱","id":"过扫描的隐藏成本与陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"窗口化模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/foundations/windowing-model"},"next":{"title":"定高与变高","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/mechanics/fixed-vs-variable-height"}}